==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''brenna''' (''intransitive, strong declension:'' [[brann]], [[brunnu]] – [[brunnið]])

# {{intransitive|lang=is}} to [[burn]], to [[be on fire]]

====Derived terms====
*[[brunninn]] {{m}}, [[brunnin]] {{f}}, [[brunnið]] {{n}}
*[[brenna við]] (to get [[burned]])
*: ''Maturinn '''brann við'''.''
*:: The food '''got burned'''.
*[[vilja brenna við]] (to [[tend to happen]])
*: ''Það '''vill brenna við'''.''
*:: It '''tends to happen'''.''
*[[brenna í skinninu]] (to be [[raring]] to go)
*: ''Hann '''brennur í skinninu'''.''
*:: He's '''raring to go'''.''
*[[láta sér ekki allt fyrir brjósti brenna]] (to be not afraid of anything)

===Verb===
'''brenna''' (''transitive, weak declension:'' [[brenndi]] – [[brennt]])

# {{transitive|lang=is}} to [[burn]]

===Noun===
'''brenna''' {{f}} ([[brennu|brenn-u]], [[brennur|brenn-ur]])

# a [[bonfire]]
#: ''Hvenær byrjar '''brennan'''?''
#:: When does the '''bonfire''' start?
# a [[burning]]

